# Sidebar list scrolling with the scrollbar and the wheel, on a repository with 60 local branches.
fixture history
wait text "feat(md): add md sample"
drag 28 5 28 9
snapshot scrollbar-drag
wheel up 10 6 80
snapshot top
wheel down 10 6 1
snapshot wheel-one
wheel down 10 6 80
snapshot wheel-end
wheel up 10 6 1
snapshot wheel-up-one
